


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_08_7cedb085:


    "进了屋的两人迅速扔掉手上的书包。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_08_7ceef952:



    voice "2HI_1288"
    hina "「早就想像这样抱住你了！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_08_959398c5:



    voice "2FU_1033"
    fumi "「我也是！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_08_77feb69e:


    "一反常态的热烈拥抱。毕竟从公交车上开始就一直黏在一起呢。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_08_ee5d6142:


    "店里的事情很早就忙完了，伦她们应该一时半会回不来。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_08_82cab297:



    voice "2HI_1289"
    hina "「唉……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_08_265f43ce:


    "把头埋在文胸间的阳菜深深地叹了口气。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_08_bff4628b:



    voice "2FU_1034"
    fumi "「是不是太累了？要不今天就不做了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_08_b2f3e99b:



    voice "2HI_1290"
    hina "「怎么可能！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_08_709e3a18:



    voice "2FU_1035"
    fumi "「噗」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_08_b8da6606:


    "如此快的回复让文不禁笑出来。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_08_06db7658:



    voice "2HI_1291"
    hina "「果然和小文待在一起好开心～」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_08_d331e9eb:



    voice "2FU_1036"
    fumi "「呵呵，我也是，和阳菜待在一起能放松下来」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_08_2f0845b1:



    voice "2HI_1292"
    hina "「感觉可以展现毫无保留的自己」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_08_fff268cb:



    voice "2FU_1037"
    fumi "「毫无保留的阳菜吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_08_ce1728fc:



    voice "2HI_1293"
    hina "「嗯，其实还是有些在意自己没女孩子样这点」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_08_9794f823:



    voice "2FU_1038"
    fumi "「怎么会！我认为阳菜是很可爱的女孩子」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_08_8de3e63e:



    voice "2HI_1294"
    hina "「不会做点心，不擅长打扮，平时还总是吵吵闹闹的」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_08_bcaa25a0:



    voice "2FU_1039"
    fumi "「那些都跟有没有女孩子样无关」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_08_dfde1b0f:



    voice "2HI_1295"
    hina "「谢谢，小文总是把我当女孩子看呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_08_a1854068:



    voice "2FU_1040"
    fumi "「当然啊，阳菜非常可爱！今后也请一直做自己本来的样子」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_08_a53ebf74:



    voice "2HI_1296"
    hina "「啊哈，现在听你这么说还是会不好意思啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_08_5392c121:


    "阳菜双手拨了拨头发害羞地说。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_08_350b2d14:



    voice "2HI_1297"
    hina "「但是在和小文交往的过程中，要有女孩子样的想法慢慢变了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_08_d055923a:



    voice "2FU_1041"
    fumi "「是吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_08_edd0bf7c:



    voice "2HI_1298"
    hina "「小文这样的是我理想中的女孩子形象」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_08_b9a8a568:



    voice "2FU_1042"
    fumi "「哇，这回换我不好意思了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_08_38cd9c41:



    voice "2HI_1299"
    hina "「所以我曾努力尝试过变得像小文一样，但太困难了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_08_ff39a377:



    voice "2FU_1043"
    fumi "「但相反，我是对阳菜这样——」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_08_3497d3b1:



    voice "2HI_1300"
    hina "「嗯，小文会这样说。所以我就有点明白了，相对于努力变得有女孩子样，保持自己的风格不是也很好吗」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_08_c5140b13:



    voice "2HI_1301"
    hina "「毕竟每个人对“有女孩子样”的印象都不一样呢，事实上我和小文想的就已经不一样了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_08_c775f98f:



    voice "2FU_1044"
    fumi "「是啊，而且还有什么普遍印象或者说大众观念之类的，更多人心中的“有女孩子样”」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_08_7665ff8d:


    "比如『喜欢粉色』，本来应该是有的女孩喜欢有的不喜欢的。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_08_8b05f4a7:



    voice "2HI_1302"
    hina "「“像什么什么样”是从别人角度去考虑的，而自己也会想着与他人比较，并为此一喜一忧的」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_08_80dbca44:



    voice "2FU_1045"
    fumi "「嗯，我懂，偶尔会因为不知现在的自己是不是自己想成为的样子而不安」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_08_838caa55:


    "不止你们俩会这么想，大家也都是如此。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_08_ae993305:



    voice "2HI_1303"
    hina "「但或许没有什么“必须要成为”，只有“想成为”怎样的女生」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_08_83ec934e:



    voice "2HI_1304"
    hina "「不过，连这个“想成为”的想法也不用去勉强，会有人喜欢现在的自己的」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_08_5fb162d1:


    "文点点头。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_08_451aa5bf:



    voice "2HI_1305"
    hina "「其实我是因为常被文夸奖，才开始喜欢上现在的自己的」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_08_c69b28ca:


    "阳菜害羞的说出了不少心里话。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_08_422b7a82:



    voice "2FU_1046"
    fumi "「真棒，阳菜很认真地想过呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_08_9d9e48d7:



    voice "2HI_1306"
    hina "「不是哦，是小文让我有这种想法的。如果我没喜欢上小文，就不会找到真正的自己了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_08_3d30a8e0:



    voice "2HI_1307"
    hina "「我只想为了你而不断改变自己」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_08_52063ce6:



    voice "2FU_1047"
    fumi "「我也想为阳菜而改变。我想这大概就是我们的风格了吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_08_ed08ae69:



    voice "2HI_1308"
    hina "「嗯嗯，我们的风格只由我们两人去决定，没必要去在意其他人的评价」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_08_f08987f2:



    voice "2FU_1048"
    fumi "「结论是能遇到阳菜真好！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_08_d94fa132:



    voice "2HI_1309"
    hina "「我才是呢！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_08_8bb93fcf:


    hina_fumi "「我不能没有小文」\n「我不能没有阳菜」" (what_rest_indent=0)


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_08_278c7e29:


    "………………"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_08_0fd4d656:


